<title>MALAYSIA: SQUASH-WOMEN'S WORLD OPEN FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-WOMEN'S WORLD OPEN FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>PETALING JAYA, Malaysia 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the</p>
<p>final of the women's World Open squash championship on Sunday:</p>
<p>2-Sarah Fitz-Gerald (Australia) beat 4-Cassie Jackman (England)</p>
<p>9-0 9-3 9-4</p>
</text>
